    "body": "Seems like this is actually prevented in their code by this condition:\r\n\r\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/platform/media/web_media_player_impl.cc;l=2118-2120;drc=4fc13c5ad1a034be2e6528404cc569b51c7b9299\r\n\r\nThis actually means that if the element is seeked to the end while paused, `ended` never becomes true at all. Despite this, `play()` restarts playback, but doesn't fire the `ended` event, so this seems like the wrong solution.",
    "created_at": "2026-09-29T13:28:03Z",
